#: includes/class-jgor-flcf7-samples.php:558
msgid "A date field, whose label stays floated because browsers show a format mask in the empty field; a select with a blank option (\"include_blank\"), whose label rests in the field until a choice is made; a required select whose first option serves as its label (\"first_as_label\"); and a select without a blank option, which always holds a value, so its label stays floated."
